Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:28.73,ED-JP,Bord,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\bord4\3c&HA324A6&}ギリギリギラギラ生きていたいね
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.89,0:21:28.73,ED-CN,Bord,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\bord4\3c&HA324A6&}想在刀刃邊緣閃閃發光地活著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:31.35,ED-JP,Bord,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\bord4\3c&HA324A6&}やっぱり君は可愛いよ（Foo！）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.73,0:21:31.35,ED-CN,Bord,0,0,0,,{\1a&HFF&\bord4\3c&HA324A6&}果然你  真的很可愛（Foo！）
